{"title":"Set REQUIRED_API_BASE env for vigil-app","body":"Root cause: The REQUIRED_API_BASE environment variable is empty, causing the Nginx configuration template to generate an invalid `proxy_pass` directive, which crashes the nginx container.

Evidence: "/docker-entrypoint.sh: ... invalid number of arguments in \"proxy_pass\" directive in /etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf:8"

The remediation updates the Deployment to set REQUIRED_API_BASE to "http://api.example.com"."}
